{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-categorical-connection-exists","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:categorical-connection-exists","kind":"proposition","title":"Existence of categorical connections","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-connection"],"proofs":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-categorical-connection-exists"],"tags":["existence","connection"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.CategoricalConnection.exists","text":"categorical-connection-exists.md","leanSource":"categorical-connection-exists.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:categorical-connection-exists\"></a><p>A categorical connection equips the observable algebra <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">A</code> with a covariant-derivative structure. The abstract triple carries the same differential geometry as a bundle with connection. Here <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\Omega^1(A)</code> plays the role of one-forms, and <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\nabla</code> sends an observable to its differential.</p>\n<p>Every <a href=\"#def:quantum-universe\" data-at=\"quantum-universes/quantum-universe\">quantum universe</a> <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(\\mathbf{C}, A, \\tau)</code> admits a <a href=\"#def:categorical-connection\" data-at=\"quantum-universes/qu-structures\">categorical connection</a>, which is a morphism <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\nabla \\colon A \\to \\Omega^1(A)</code> satisfying the Leibniz rule. Uniqueness up to gauge is the next proposition.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/categorical-connection-exists.md","heading":"Proposition","number":"3.6.2","page":"b/prop-categorical-connection-exists","qa":{"counts":{"pass":92,"fail":2,"warn":0,"na":10,"unknown":0,"stale":80},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":1}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.CategoricalConnection.exists","via":"sibling","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-universes/categorical-connection-exists.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
